  <Properties>
    <Name>Cool Wacky Civs 3</Name>
    <Teaser>The Ministry of Almost, The Hollow Choir and The Seventeenth Summer.</Teaser>
    <Description>Independent human-only civilization pack for BNW + Community Patch v151. Science, Culture and defensive recovery without permanent stacking.</Description>
